  <property name="kdenlive:sequenceproperties.guides">[
    {
        "comment": "1: the hook (he makes his own music), why it's great, and the first example; ends on 3 s of its intense music",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 0,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "2: calm parts, transitions, and the music turning intense again; ends on the music's jump",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 560,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "3: take 2 of the drone line (concrete, fluent), then the crash where the music stops",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 930,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "4: the lead-in, \"Ja tää on niinku sellas, mitä ei silleen\" (the pause after it cut)",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 1246,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "5: no stock music or AI can do it",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 1309,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "6: fun to make (pause after \"silleen\" cut)",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 1472,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "7: the rest, \"tosi siisti ite tehdä ja nyplätä\" (\"Se on niinku hauskaa\" left out, says it again)",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 1562,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "8: Mä niinku sytyn ite siitä",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 1629,
        "type": 0
    },
    {
        "comment": "9: the close, nobody else does this",
        "duration": 0,
        "pos": 1682,
        "type": 0
    }
]
</property>
